      "body": "Full year 2025 results: EPS: ₹30.89 (up from ₹25.27 in FY 2024). Revenue: ₹78.3b (up 9.7% from FY 2024). Net income: ₹11.0b (up 22% from FY 2024). Profit margin: 14% (up from 13% in FY 2024). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 5.5%. Earnings per share (EPS) were mostly in line with analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 20% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 20% growth forecast for the Electrical industry in India.",
